# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment files - never commit these. Vite exposes any VITE_-prefixed variable
# to the browser bundle, so treat everything in here as public-facing config, and
# keep genuinely secret keys (Supabase service_role, OAuth client secrets) out of
# the project entirely - they belong in the Supabase/Vercel dashboards.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Raw purchased asset library (zips/rars/aseprite sources) - not tracked.
# Only the specific files actually used by the game live under public/sprites.
/Assets

# Raw sound source files - the served copies live under public/sounds.
/sounds

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
